    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: 8b850a18816e00d4ae1757c1de70b59e67cf3b84 -->\n**Review (M3, local PR-reviewer, posted under PROCESS_VERSION 32): the code is clean, but the PR conflicts with main.**\n\n**Blocker: merge `upstream/main`.** The conflict is mechanical, in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests.rs:145-151`: this PR's `mod wcs_footer;` sits beside main's `mod setup_mount_pages;` (#1206). Keep both lines.\n\n**Laws:** all hold.\n- Apply goes through `CommandKind::SetWcs`.\n- No unwrap; the structural twin is added; no snapshot PNGs.\n- No process files are touched.\n\n**Tests on the trial-merged tree:**\n- app: `setup_wcs` 8, `setup_sheet` 7, `rotated_wcs` 9, `setup_align` 10, `program_entry` 9; app lib `setup_origin` 3.\n- ui lib: 619 passed single-threaded.\n- ui integration binaries: pass.\n- Clippy: clean.\n\n**Notes:**\n- `pages.rs` (1763 lines) grows by 7 lines.\n- This PR overlaps #759; whichever merges second drops the body button.\n",
