    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: 9637869a71f59aa3c157e624e4cb1e51103198a1 -->\n**Delta review at 9637869a: ready for the maintainer to merge.**\n\n**The delta:** the only change since 8b850a18 is a merge of upstream main. Its one hand-resolved hunk, `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests.rs:145-151`, correctly keeps both `mod wcs_footer;` and `mod setup_mount_pages;`. A trial merge with current main (beb9e5b9) is clean.\n\n**Tests on the merged tree:**\n- `camcraft-ui` lib, single-threaded: 619 passed.\n- app: `setup_wcs` 8, `setup_sheet` 7, `rotated_wcs` 9, `setup_align` 10, `program_entry` 9.\n- Clippy on app and ui is clean.\n\n**Laws:** both new modules have provenance lines; there is no unwrap or panic; the layering holds; no snapshot or process files changed; the decision file is present.\n\nNothing is requested. Thanks for the quick merge.\n",
