    "body": "**Held by the maintainer before merge: please add screenshots.**\n\nThe review is clean and nothing in the code is being asked to change. The maintainer could not picture what this PR does from the description alone, so it is not merged yet.\n\nPlease add to the PR description:\n\n- a screenshot of the WCS page **before** the change (the *Set Origin* button in the page body);\n- a screenshot **after** it: the footer with *Set origin* beside *Close*, and the new origin line under the heading;\n- one screenshot with a typed but unapplied edit, showing the **Origin not applied** flag.\n\nScreenshots in the PR description are enough: no snapshot PNGs in the branch, and no new push is needed for them. One or two sentences on the idea in a user's words (what was confusing before, what they see now) would help as well.\n\nFrom now on a PR that changes what a page looks like should carry a before/after screenshot in its description.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
